                            "Step {} ({}) succeeded after {} retries",
                            step_index, agent_id, attempt
                        );
                    }
                    return Ok(output);
                }
                Err(e) => {
                    warn!(
                        "Step {} ({}) failed (attempt {}/{}): {}",
